# Mock CSV Only

- Do not commit or push business CSV files
- The only CSV file that may be committed is `mmm/data/mmm_demo_sample.csv`
- Treat any other CSV as local-only unless the user explicitly asks for an exception
- If a CSV is already tracked by mistake, remove it from version control while keeping it local unless the user says otherwise
